77cedd2d-57e0-4eac-b9a4-9f620572e799	a083274c-377e-475a-a64d-9ac9f531b939	assistant	Bilkul! Yeh raha ek basic Python code jo Raspberry Pi ke GPIO pin se fan ko on/off karega.\n\n```python\nimport RPi.GPIO as GPIO\nimport time\n\nPin setup\nFAN_PIN = 18\nGPIO.setmode(GPIO.BCM)\nGPIO.setup(FAN_PIN, GPIO.OUT)\n\ntry:\n    while True:\n        choice = input("Fan ON (1), OFF (0), or QUIT (q): ")\n        if choice == '1':\n            GPIO.output(FAN_PIN, GPIO.HIGH)\n            print("Fan is ON")\n        elif choice == '0':\n            GPIO.output(FAN_PIN, GPIO.LOW)\n            print("Fan is OFF")\n        elif choice == 'q':\n            break\nfinally:\n    GPIO.cleanup()\n```\n\nIsme fan ka positive wire pin 18 se connect karo (relay ke through, kyunki Raspberry Pi direct motor nahi chala sakta) aur ground ko GND se. Relay module use karna zaroori hai taaki Pi safe rahe.\n\nAgar aapko relay wiring ya koi aur help chahiye, toh batao! Aur haan, agar kabhi ghar ka koi kaam ho toh main yahan hoon. 😄	unknown	[]	4438	277	2026-08-07 16:44:13.985004+05:30
