b7168ad0-8d79-4025-8ca5-558f27241b52	job-lifecycle	The job lifecycle end to end	From booking confirmation through dispatch, on-site execution, completion and invoicing.	A confirmed booking creates a service job. The job moves through assigned, accepted, en route, in progress, completed and then invoiced. Only the assigned technician or an owner/manager can advance it.	bookings_jobs	["job", "status", "lifecycle", "dispatch", "complete"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
e410f54c-84c0-49e0-a142-193812e526e4	invite-team-members	Invite staff and technicians and set their access	Roles available in the tenant portal and what each role can and cannot do.	Owners can invite team members from Staff & Technicians. Managers can run day-to-day operations; technicians see only their own assigned jobs; read-only users can view but not change anything.	team_access	["team", "staff", "technician", "invite", "role", "permission"]	\N	\N	t	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
e0e10e00-1e11-415b-b624-14c3135d126c	technician-cannot-sign-in	A technician cannot sign in to the staff app	Lockouts, password resets and deactivated team members.	Confirm the team member is active, then trigger a password reset from their profile. Repeated failed sign-ins temporarily lock the account; the lock clears automatically.	team_access	["login", "staff app", "technician", "locked", "password"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
02ef7319-3e53-448f-8164-69d86409f895	pricing-not-applying	A price is not applying to a booking	Resolution order for base price, service options, modifiers and promotions.	Pricing resolves in a fixed order: job-type base, selected service options, area/time modifiers, then promotions. A draft or unpublished price is never used for a live booking.	services_pricing	["price", "pricing", "not applying", "option", "modifier"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
d2830019-c372-4ef6-b418-2cdb65dcf665	usage-credits-explained	How usage credits are charged and topped up	What consumes credit, when it is deducted and how low-balance warnings work.	Usage credit is deducted per chargeable platform action according to your active package. Low-balance warnings appear in the portal before service is restricted.	finance_credits	["credit", "usage", "top up", "balance", "wallet"]	\N	\N	t	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
78ec8ae4-c020-4afa-abf2-bc83a95fe3f9	security-deposit-refund	Security deposit: holds, deductions and refunds	When a deposit is held, what can be deducted and how to request a refund.	Your security deposit is held against platform obligations. Refund requests are reviewed by the ServiceOS finance team; approved refunds are returned to the original payment method.	finance_credits	["deposit", "refund", "security", "hold"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
f8450aa7-aec0-4342-a65e-45980b79cbcc	direct-payment-records	Recording a direct or cash payment correctly	Evidence requirements and how reconciliation decides accepted vs rejected.	Record the amount actually collected and attach the receipt or UPI reference. Records without verifiable evidence are rejected during reconciliation.	finance_credits	["cash", "direct payment", "reconcile", "evidence"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
1b29fe05-4bbe-4459-aeca-2198d6c5c5bb	sign-in-problems	Cannot sign in to the tenant portal	Lockouts, expired sessions, forced password changes and two-person accounts.	Use Forgot password first. Repeated failures lock the account temporarily. If your account is flagged for a forced password change you will be redirected before reaching the dashboard.	account_security	["login", "sign in", "locked", "401", "password"]	\N	\N	t	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
9abe25e9-c590-4276-b248-5aa2b21c54e5	notification-not-received	You are not receiving notifications	Channel preferences, mandatory notifications and delivery troubleshooting.	Check Notifications for your channel preferences. Some notifications are mandatory and cannot be disabled. In-app notifications are always delivered.	account_security	["notification", "email", "not receiving", "alert"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
a415af78-e717-4cb5-952b-e7b5b8f0c9fe	keep-your-account-secure	Keeping your ServiceOS account secure	Password hygiene, team offboarding and what ServiceOS support will never ask you for.	ServiceOS support will never ask for your password, an OTP, or card/UPI credentials. Remove departing team members immediately and review access periodically.	account_security	["security", "password", "otp", "phishing", "safe"]	\N	\N	f	t	v1	0	0	0	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30	2026-07-30 15:03:26.222973+05:30
